[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5614419624","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123353#issuecomment-5614419624","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123353","id":5614419624,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTqU-qA","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:53:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:53:25Z","body":"I opened #123357, which circumvents the issue by allowing empty lines to act as paragraph breaks. To get the \"after\" documentation using your example code, you can do the following instead:\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Example description.\r\n##\r\n## [note]This is a note.[/note]\r\n##\r\n## [warning]This is a warning.[/warning]\r\n##\r\n## [important]This is important.[/important]\r\n##\r\n## [tip]This is a tip.[/tip]\r\n@export var example_no_br = \"\"\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5614419624/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637550923","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123353#issuecomment-5637550923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123353","id":5637550923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUAYzSw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-11T16:32:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T16:32:28Z","body":"I've incorporated the suggestion from the first comment and added @Cykyrios as a co-author. Thanks 🙂 ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5637550923/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5643864578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123353#issuecomment-5643864578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123353","id":5643864578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUGaKAg","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T05:39:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T05:39:01Z","body":"Since #123357 was merged, I had another look at this, as it now includes 2 paragraph breaks if there is an empty comment line before the admonition. I think the easiest way to fix this is to remove my previous suggestion, and add a space before the admonition tags you want to replace (the space that comes from line joining): if there is no space, it likely means the admonition comes after a paragraph break and doesn't need an extra break; if there is a space, it means there was no paragraph break or `[br]` tag before the admonition.\r\n\r\nImplications of these changes best explained with the following examples:\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Some sentence.[note]Test note.[/note] -> no space = no line/paragraph break\r\n##\r\n## Another sentence.[br]\r\n## [note]Line break, but no paragraph break.[/note]\r\n##\r\n## Another one, with [code][note][/code] mentioned -> no break, expected.\r\n##\r\n## Last one.[br][br]\r\n## [note]No *added* paragraph break because of no space, but there is one from the br tags.[/note]\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5643864578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5702302943","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123353#issuecomment-5702302943","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123353","id":5702302943,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU-I83w","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T18:12:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T18:23:36Z","body":"> I think the easiest way to fix this is to remove my previous suggestion\r\n\r\nDone:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"636\" height=\"259\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6abd0079-0e7b-459c-9670-9f04a36345db\" />\r\n\r\nThe `example_no_br` above still looks as intended (same as the \"After\" screenshot in OP).\r\n\r\n> and add a space before the admonition tags you want to replace (the space that comes from line joining): if there is no space, it likely means the admonition comes after a paragraph break and doesn't need an extra break; if there is a space, it means there was no paragraph break or `[br]` tag before the admonition.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean by this part though. What part of the code do I need to change in my PR? I've tried to add a space before the replaced admonition tags, but it didn't visually change anything.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5702302943/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5702611650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123353#issuecomment-5702611650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123353","id":5702611650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABU-bywg","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T18:34:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T18:34:47Z","body":"I meant this part:\r\n```cpp\r\n.replace(\" [note]\", \"\\n[note]\")\r\n```\r\nto prevent the inline code `[note]` in the example screenshot from being sent to a new line (which by the way, looks more like a line break than a paragraph break here? It should be on the same line as the beginning of the sentence).\r\n\r\nBy adding a space in `.replace(\" [note]\"`, it should prevent this kind of accidental breaks, and should also avoid double paragraph breaks, which I think is the reason the last admonition appears to have a larger gap (because of the `[br][br]` and the added `\\n` before `[note]`).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5702611650/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5737791532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123353#issuecomment-5737791532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123353","id":5737791532,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVf_ALA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-19T00:22:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T00:22:08Z","body":"> I meant this part:\r\n\r\nDone:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"634\" height=\"155\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/940c7933-7adf-40b7-8766-882bd1b445f0\" />\r\n\r\n`example_no_br` and `example_with_br` from OP now look identical with this change, which I think is better anyway.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5737791532/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]